e></person-group><article-title>A Ten-Year Trend of the Prevalence of Hepatitis B Surface Antigen in Pregnant Women at Songklanaga-rind Hospital</article-title>. <source>J Infect Dis Antimicrob Agents</source>. <year>2005</year>; <volume>22</volume>:<fpage>111</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>4</lpage></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>